    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Features:</strong><br>\u00b7   Simplified RTS + Tribute to Classics<br>\u00b7   Deep Strategy and Independent Controls<br>\u00b7   Unique Boss Fights <br>\u2764\ufe0fLocal Co-op<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/ddc6018872015725fc8084e87dd20c68.poster.avif?t=1754362765\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/ddc6018872015725fc8084e87dd20c68.webm?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/ddc6018872015725fc8084e87dd20c68.mp4?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As a die-hard RTS fan, I know the complex controls can be daunting for some players. That's why I aimed to create an RTS game that's easy to control yet rich in strategy and action. Here, you control just one mech. It can walk, shoot, kill insects, gather resources, build, and summon. This game is my passion project, and I hope to share that passion with more players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/99574b9ee71bfb1062cf76a12846a0e7.poster.avif?t=1754362765\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/99574b9ee71bfb1062cf76a12846a0e7.webm?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/99574b9ee71bfb1062cf76a12846a0e7.mp4?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Pre-Battle Phase: </strong>Strategize and set up your defenses at your own pace. <br><strong>Combat Phase: </strong>Execute your strategy and unleash your firepower. <br><br>Whether it's resource gathering, base building, or attacking, this game keeps you thinking and acting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/8fb5e432b56a3c5ddb077def6912f061.poster.avif?t=1754362765\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/8fb5e432b56a3c5ddb077def6912f061.webm?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/8fb5e432b56a3c5ddb077def6912f061.mp4?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This isn't a Roguelike game. It progresses through levels, each ending with a unique boss fight. Defeat the boss to unlock new items and expand your build options. I'm not a fan of reading long descriptions, so I've simplified each module for easy understanding. <br><br>Plus, you can team up with a friend to fight off relentless alien swarms! One player handles ground forces, the other takes to the skies, complementing each other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/aac4f51745c3eb0ae3b730acc0d02298.poster.avif?t=1754362765\" width=614 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/aac4f51745c3eb0ae3b730acc0d02298.webm?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/aac4f51745c3eb0ae3b730acc0d02298.mp4?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the distant future, humanity faces an unprecedented energy crisis. A new energy source, &quot;Force&quot;, discovered in outer space, becomes a coveted treasure. The battle for &quot;Force&quot; leads to a prolonged war between humans and vicious alien swarms. In the war\u2019s final stages, both sides have mastered each other\u2019s genetic sequences, creating many half-human, half-alien warriors. On the battlefield, we might see our mutated former comrades. War devours countless lives, and we seem to have forgotten who our real enemy is.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Features:</strong><br>\u00b7   Simplified RTS + Tribute to Classics<br>\u00b7   Deep Strategy and Independent Controls<br>\u00b7   Unique Boss Fights <br>\u2764\ufe0fLocal Co-op<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/ddc6018872015725fc8084e87dd20c68.poster.avif?t=1754362765\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/ddc6018872015725fc8084e87dd20c68.webm?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/ddc6018872015725fc8084e87dd20c68.mp4?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As a die-hard RTS fan, I know the complex controls can be daunting for some players. That's why I aimed to create an RTS game that's easy to control yet rich in strategy and action. Here, you control just one mech. It can walk, shoot, kill insects, gather resources, build, and summon. This game is my passion project, and I hope to share that passion with more players.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/99574b9ee71bfb1062cf76a12846a0e7.poster.avif?t=1754362765\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/99574b9ee71bfb1062cf76a12846a0e7.webm?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/99574b9ee71bfb1062cf76a12846a0e7.mp4?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Pre-Battle Phase: </strong>Strategize and set up your defenses at your own pace. <br><strong>Combat Phase: </strong>Execute your strategy and unleash your firepower. <br><br>Whether it's resource gathering, base building, or attacking, this game keeps you thinking and acting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/8fb5e432b56a3c5ddb077def6912f061.poster.avif?t=1754362765\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/8fb5e432b56a3c5ddb077def6912f061.webm?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/8fb5e432b56a3c5ddb077def6912f061.mp4?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This isn't a Roguelike game. It progresses through levels, each ending with a unique boss fight. Defeat the boss to unlock new items and expand your build options. I'm not a fan of reading long descriptions, so I've simplified each module for easy understanding. <br><br>Plus, you can team up with a friend to fight off relentless alien swarms! One player handles ground forces, the other takes to the skies, complementing each other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/aac4f51745c3eb0ae3b730acc0d02298.poster.avif?t=1754362765\" width=614 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/aac4f51745c3eb0ae3b730acc0d02298.webm?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3139620/extras/aac4f51745c3eb0ae3b730acc0d02298.mp4?t=1754362765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the distant future, humanity faces an unprecedented energy crisis. A new energy source, &quot;Force&quot;, discovered in outer space, becomes a coveted treasure. The battle for &quot;Force&quot; leads to a prolonged war between humans and vicious alien swarms. In the war\u2019s final stages, both sides have mastered each other\u2019s genetic sequences, creating many half-human, half-alien warriors. On the battlefield, we might see our mutated former comrades. War devours countless lives, and we seem to have forgotten who our real enemy is.",
    "short_description": "Defend humanity's last hope, pilot a powerful mech, in Frontlines Crisis! A battlefield swarming with insects makes strategic and combat decisions crucial. Each decision will determine your fate. Defend humanity's last sanctuary, fight fiercely, and uphold human honor with wits and courage!",
